              "text": "der Zeitraum — \"the period, the span of time\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "In diesem Zeitraum gab es drei Unfälle. In this period there were three accidents."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: die Zeiträume. Common in reports: im Zeitraum von Mai bis Juli."
            }
          ]
        },
