          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Zeitraum joins Zeit \"time\" and Raum \"room, space\", from Old High German rūm (EtymDB): a stretch of room in time. Both are inherited Germanic words."
            }
          ]
        },
